     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1-	Develop and implement a campaign and ads strategy for Anti-corruption videos, as part of a knowledge sharing and awareness raising on anti-corruption in Lebanon.
2-	Develop an interactive chat bot on Facebook to raise awareness in an innovative way and targeted for specific audience.
3-	Increase knowledge of women organizations on anti-corruption in Lebanon.
4-	Provide technical support in drafting legislation to Parliamentarians.
5-	Provide technical support to OMSAR in the implementation of the Access to Information Law, through providing advice on the development of a guide for Information Officers on the law.
